Emphasized on the applications of the laws of physics. Vectors. Motions in 1-, 2-, and
3-dimensions. Newton’s laws of motion. Energy and work. Linear momentum. Rotation.
Torque and angular momentum. Equilibrium and elasticity. Fluids. Oscillations. Waves and
sound. Thermodynamics. The kinetic theory of gases.
